DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy.pipe` materializes `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds` from `cncf_collection_activities_ds`: one row per month, organization and country.
    - An organization's country is its stored country code, looked up in `country_mapping_ds`, so each organization lands in at most one country. Organizations without a country code are left out.
    - Organizations that can't appear in reports (`organizationListed` is 0) are left out, as in the `cncf_country_*` pipes.
    - Activities dated before 1980 are placeholder timestamps (the 1970 epoch) and are left out.
    - Runs daily at 11:50 UTC, after `cncf_collection_activities_copy.pipe` (11:30 UTC, about 3 minutes) refreshes its source.
    - Full-replace, since the source is itself a daily full replace.

TAGS "Report"

NODE cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy_countries
SQL >
    SELECT country, flag, country_code FROM country_mapping_ds WHERE country_code != 'XX'

NODE cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy_result
SQL >
    SELECT
        a.month AS month,
        a.organizationId AS organizationId,
        c.country AS country,
        c.flag AS flag,
        c.country_code AS country_code
    FROM
        (
            SELECT DISTINCT toStartOfMonth(timestamp) AS month, organizationId, organizationCountryCode
            FROM cncf_collection_activities_ds
            WHERE
                organizationId != ''
                AND organizationCountryCode != ''
                AND organizationListed = 1
                AND timestamp > '1980-01-01'
        ) AS a
    INNER JOIN
        cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy_countries AS c
        ON c.country_code = a.organizationCountryCode

TYPE COPY
TARGET_DATASOURCE cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds
COPY_MODE replace
COPY_SCHEDULE 50 11 * * *
